# Project

- Unity 6 (`6000.5.9f1`). Scripts currently live under `Assets/Script/`.
- The project is early. Prefer small, explicit changes over new frameworks, packages, or folder trees.
- Do not add store, IAP, ads, or paid-advantage systems.
- Do not generate final art, audio, or a visual theme. Placeholders only until the user chooses one.
- Match existing naming and layout instead of renaming the project to a “standard” Unity template.
